are not part of this work, are not linked into the `achilles` binary, and are
licensed by their own authors under their own terms; some are downloaded on your
request by `achilles tools install` rather than distributed with it. The list,
versions and licenses are in THIRD-PARTY.md. If you redistribute Achilles together
with any of them, you take on the notice and source-offer obligations of their
licenses (notably LGPL for Opengrep).

The Achilles binaries link third-party Go modules and the Go standard library.
Their licenses and notices are reproduced in third_party/licenses/ (in the release
archives) and /usr/share/doc/achilles/licenses/ (in the container image).
